{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 19,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Conspiracy Against Nehemiah"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it happened when Sanballat, Tobiah, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Gashmu"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Geshem the Arab, and the rest of our enemies heard that I had rebuilt the wall, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " there were no breaks left in it (though at that time I had not hung the doors in the gates), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that Sanballat and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or Gashmu"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Geshem sent to me, saying, “Come, let us meet together "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or in Kephirim, exact location unknown"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "among the villages in the plain of Ono.” But they thought to do me harm."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So I sent messengers to them, saying, “I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " doing a great work, so that I cannot come down. Why should the work cease while I leave it and go down to you?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they sent me this message four times, and I answered them in the same manner."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Sanballat sent his servant to me as before, the fifth time, with an open letter in his hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is reported among the nations, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. Gashmu"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Geshem says, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you and the Jews plan to rebel; therefore, according to these rumors, you are rebuilding the wall, that you may be their king. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you have also appointed prophets to proclaim concerning you at Jerusalem, saying, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a king in Judah!” Now these matters will be reported to the king. So come, therefore, and let us consult together."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I sent to him, saying, “No such things as you say are being done, but you invent them in your own heart.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For they all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were trying to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " make us afraid, saying, “Their hands will be weakened in the work, and it will not be done.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "O God,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " strengthen my hands."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Afterward I came to the house of Shemaiah the son of Delaiah, the son of Mehetabel, who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a secret informer; and he said, “Let us meet together in the house of God, within the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple, and let us close the doors of the temple, for they are coming to kill you; indeed, at night they will come to kill you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I said, “Should such a man as I flee? And who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is there"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " such as I who would go into the temple to save his life? I will not go in!” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I perceived that God had not sent him at all, but that he pronounced "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " prophecy against me because Tobiah and Sanballat had hired him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For this reason he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hired, that I should be afraid and act that way and sin, so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they might have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "cause"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for an evil report, that they might reproach me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My God, remember Tobiah and Sanballat, according to these their works, and the prophetess Noadiah and the rest of the prophets who would have made me afraid."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Wall Completed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the wall was finished on the twenty-fifth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Elul, in fifty-two days. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it happened, when all our enemies heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and all the nations around us saw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "these things,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that they were very disheartened in their own eyes; for they perceived that this work was done by our God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also in those days the nobles of Judah sent many letters to Tobiah, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the letters of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Tobiah came to them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For many in Judah were pledged to him, because he was the son-in-law of Shechaniah the son of Arah, and his son Jehohanan had married the daughter of Meshullam the son of Berechiah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also they reported his good deeds before me, and reported my "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or affairs"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "words to him. Tobiah sent letters to frighten me."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}